== FAILS-direction counterexample: Hamming loss on Even process ==
P(next=1|A)=0.50, P(next=1|B)=1.00: 'always predict 1' is Bayes-optimal in every causal state; memoryless agent has zero excess Hamming risk and I(M;S)=0.  -> model of S NOT forced by this loss
